    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 20, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Artificial creature made from Hardin's magic experiment. Although it has the body of a monster erupting lava all over, it used to be an obedient golem that followed Hardin like a father. It went crazy after Hardin left this Swamp of Flames with the thought that it was deserted. When King Astaire invaded Aden Kingdom, some Elmore soldiers trapped in the Swamp of Flames witnessed a giant covered with lava. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 5 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
